following:
(i
Assaults or battery;
(i)
Felony or violent criminal offenses, including but not limited to
robbery, extortion, arson, or sexual assault;
(ii)
Use or possession of dangerous weapons by a student, including but
not limited to: knives, guns, and explosive devices;
