O.
The District shall provide eachSRO limited access to the District's Infinite
Campus system toinclude student name, address, parent orguardian contact
information, in accordance with local, state and federal law.The SROs will
be required to complete annual Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act
(FERPA) training.The training will be required prior to or at the beginning
